""Shining Down"" is a song by Lupe Fiasco.  It was intended to be the first single of ""Everywhere"", the first of three CDs of Lupe Fiasco's triple album, ""Lupe Fiasco's LupE.N.D."" , but because of its release being withheld, there was speculation circulating that it may be the first single of his third album, ""Lasers"".  The song, however, was only included in the iTunes deluxe version of the album and was considered a promotional single.  The song is produced by Soundtrakk and features Matthew",none,n/a,substring,True,True,True,recursive,500,100,32,ollama,mxbai-embed-large,1024,hybrid,5,5,1825,,,ollama,local,qwen3.5:0.8b,Q8_0,hotpotqa,42
