## 3005
""3005"" (album version entitled ""V. 3005"") is a song by American rapper Childish Gambino from his second studio album ""Because the Internet"".  The song was released on October 22, 2013 as the first official single from the album.  It has since peaked at number 11 on the UK R&B Chart and 64 on the ""Billboard"" Hot 100.

