## Because the Internet
Because the Internet is the second studio album by American rapper Donald Glover, under the stage name Childish Gambino.  It was released on December 10, 2013, by Glassnote Records and Island Records, and then four days later in North America by Glassnote and Universal.  The recording process began in 2012 and ended in October 2013.  Recording primarily took place at a mansion owned by basketball player Chris Bosh, which Gambino rented.

