Lemon Wallet was a cloud-based digital wallet that allowed users to store digital copies of credit cards, debit cards, reward cards, as well as identification, and other card information.  The service was released in July 2011 and the company is based in Palo Alto, California, United States.  Wences Casares is the company’s CEO.

