naive,recursive,qwen3.5:0.8b,What historic province of Ireland is home to the 2017 Antrim Senior Football Championship and County Antrim?,Ulster,Ulster,1.0,True,5.0,5.0,5.0,5.0,1601.8071999997119,5.0,5.0,5.0,5.0,1233.7936000003538,5.0,577.0695000001069,2835.6008000000656,3412.6703000001726,"County Antrim (named after the town of Antrim, from Irish: ""Aontroim"" , meaning ""lone ridge"" , )) is one of six counties that form Northern Ireland.  Adjoined to the north-east shore of Lough Neagh, the county covers an area of 3046 km2 and has a population of about 618,000.  County Antrim has a population density of 203 people per square kilometer / 526 people per square mile.  It is also one of the thirty-two traditional counties of Ireland, as well as part of the historic province of Ulster.

