Pal is the debut solo Studio Album by Indipop artist and Playback Singer KK.  It was released on 16 April 1999 by Sony.  The album is Arranged, Composed and produced by Lesle Lewis while the lyrics are written by Mehboob.  All the tracks are sung by KK.

