## Andrej Nestrašil
Andrej Nestrasil (born February 22, 1991) is a Czech professional ice hockey player, who is currently an unrestricted free agent.  He was most recently under contract to the Carolina Hurricanes of the National Hockey League (NHL).  Nestrasil was drafted 75th overall by the Detroit Red Wings in the 2009 NHL Entry Draft.

