Kennedy Ihenacho (born December 16, 1990) is a Nigerian footballer currently playing for Burgan Sports Club Kuwait.  He moved to Kuwait after his contract expiration with the VSI TAMPA BAY FC in the United States USL league 2013 season.  Kennedy Ihenacho has played for Roi Et FC in Thailand, Niger Tornadoes FC and Dolphins FC both in Nigeria.

