of famous naval battles during his career, such as the Battle of the Saintes, the Glorious First of June and the Battle of Tory Island, where he received the sword of the French commodore, Jean Bompart.  His record also includes extensive operations in the West Indies and the Baltic Sea, followed by the expedition to New Orleans in 1815.",none,n/a,substring,True,True,True,recursive,500,100,24,ollama,mxbai-embed-large,1024,hybrid,5,5,1882,,,ollama,local,qwen3.5:0.8b,Q8_0,hotpotqa,42
