## P2 (film)
P2 is a 2007 American-Canadian horror thriller film directed by Franck Khalfoun; written and produced by Khalfoun, Alexandre Aja and Grégory Levasseur; and starring Rachel Nichols and Wes Bentley.  The trio of Khalfoun, Aja and Levasseur also worked on the 2006 film ""The Hills Have Eyes"".

