Amityville: The Awakening is a 2017 American supernatural horror film written and directed by Franck Khalfoun.  It is the tenth installment of the main ""Amityville"" film series and a direct sequel to ""The Amityville Horror"" (1979), which ignores the subsequent sequels from the original series from 1982 to 1996 and the 2005 remake of the original film.  The film stars Bella Thorne, Cameron Monaghan, Jennifer Jason Leigh, Thomas Mann, Jennifer Morrison and Kurtwood Smith.  The film is scheduled

