## Waterloo Road (series 5)
The fifth series of the British television drama series ""Waterloo Road"" began broadcasting on 25 October 2009, and ended on 15 July 2010 on BBC One. The series follows the lives of the faculty and pupils of the Eponymous school, a failing inner-city comprehensive school.

In 2014, it was confirmed that the 10th series of ""Waterloo Road"" would be the last. The first episode was broadcast on BBC One on 9 March 2006 and the final episode on BBC Three on 9 March 2015. ""Waterloo Road"" ran for 10 series, 200 episodes and exactly 9 years. Reruns air on CBS Drama in the UK. As of the beginning of August 2017, full episodes of Series One and Series Two have been uploaded to the Waterloo Road YouTube channel.

