Herr Kleiser is a fictional character appearing in American comic books published by Marvel Comics. The character has appeared in ""Ultimate"" comic books. The character first appeared in ""Ultimates"" #10 (July 2003) and was created by writer Mark Millar and artist Bryan Hitch. ---

