Qu Shengqing (; Pinyin: ""Qū Shèngqīng"" born June 5, 1975) is a Chinese football coach and former international player. As a player, he is well known for his time with Liaoning FC where he won the Golden Boot in the 1999 league season before joining Shanghai Shenhua and winning the 2003 league title with them.

