## Turn It Up (Chamillionaire song)
""Turn It Up"" is the 2005 debut single of Chamillionaire, featuring Lil' Flip. It was produced by Scott Storch. ""Turn It Up"" was the first single from Chamillionaire's major label debut album, ""The Sound of Revenge"". The music video is filmed in Houston, and features cameo appearances by Z-Ro, Crooked I, Mannie Fresh and Chamillionaire's brother Rasaq.

