## Toyota TF110
The Toyota TF110 was an un-raced, prototype Formula One car designed by Toyota Racing for the 2010 Formula One season. The car had been designed, and two chassis produced before Toyota officially decided to pull out of Formula One at the end of the 2009 Formula One season.

in July 2016. She has also been the team's chief executive officer from January 2010. She was the first female team principal in Formula One. ---

