""I'll See It Through"" is a single by Scottish band Texas and the second to be taken from their seventh studio album ""Careful What You Wish For"".  The song was released on 8 December 2003 and charted at #40 in the UK before falling to #57 in its second week then falling out the UK charts at #65.  The song was also included in the Love Actually OST.

