## Caroline Aherne
Caroline Mary Aherne (24 December 1963 – 2 July 2016) was an English comedian and BAFTA-winning writer and actress, best known for performing as the acerbic chat show host ""Mrs Merton"", various roles in ""The Fast Show"", and as the lead role in ""The Royle Family"", which she co-wrote.  She narrated the Channel 4 reality television series ""Gogglebox ""from its inception in 2013 until April 2016.

