## Irene Ng (politician)
Irene Ng Phek Hoong (; born 24 December 1963) is a former Malaysian-born Singaporean politician who represented Tampines GRC from 2001 to 2015.  She is also a Writer-in-Residence at the Institute of Southeast Asian Studies (ISEAS).

