Edin Osmanović (born 20 May 1964) is a Slovenian-Bosnian UEFA Pro football coach who is currently the head coach of Slovenian team Fužinar.  He began his career in Rudar Trbovlje and later coached many clubs in the Slovenian PrvaLiga, the highest level in Slovenian football, including Celje, Gorica, Rudar Velenje, Korotan Prevalje, Dravograd, Aluminij, and Mura 05.

