## Ms. G.O.A.T.
Ms. G.O.A.T., an acronym for """"Greatest Of All Time"""", is the debut mixtape by Lil' Kim.  It was officially released on June 3, 2008 and was produced by Mister Cee and DJ Whoo Kid, DJ's from New York City.  The title references the 2000 album G.O.A.T. by American rapper LL Cool J.

