## Brent Sexton
Brent Sexton (born August 12, 1967) is an American actor best known for his roles in the television series ""Bosch"", ""The Killing"", ""Life"", and ""Deadwood"".  He has also guest starred in several other television series, such as ""Justified"", ""That's Life"", ""Birds of Prey"", """", and ""Judging Amy"".  He has also appeared in several motion pictures, such as ""In the Valley of Elah"", ""Flightplan"", ""Radio"", and ""A.I. Artificial Intelligence"".

