The Forum is a multi-purpose indoor arena in Inglewood, California, adjacent to Los Angeles.",none,n/a,substring,True,True,True,sentence,,,10,ollama,mxbai-embed-large,1024,hybrid,5,5,2934,,,ollama,local,qwen3.5:2b,Q8_0,hotpotqa,42
