## NTrust
nTrust is a Canadian technology business, headquartered in Vancouver, BC, Canada. The company provides a bitcoin wallet and exchange, primarily to Canadian members. nTrust offers the ability to buy or sell bitcoin and store it, send it to another member or an external bitcoin address, or withdraw it to a bank account. nTrust is a money services business registered with the Financial Transactions and Reports Analysis Centre of Canada (FINTRAC) and is strictly regulated. nTrust is also PCI-DSS Level One certified.",none,n/a,substring,True,True,True,sentence,,,10,ollama,mxbai-embed-large,1024,hybrid,5,5,2971,,,ollama,local,qwen3.5:2b,Q8_0,hotpotqa,42
