## Alien Arena (video game)
Alien Arena (initially CodeRED: Alien Arena) is a free, stand-alone first-person shooter computer game. Begun by COR Entertainment in 2004, the game combines a 1950s-era sci-fi atmosphere with gameplay similar to the ""Quake"", ""Doom"", and ""Unreal Tournament"" series.

