Kalamazoo is a city in the southwest region of the U.S. state of Michigan.",none,n/a,substring,True,True,True,sentence,,,12,ollama,mxbai-embed-large,1024,hybrid,5,5,2843,,,ollama,local,qwen3.5:2b,Q8_0,hotpotqa,42
