## Zelo
Choi Jun-hong (Hangul: 최준홍; born October 15, 1996) better known by his stage name Zelo, is a South Korean rapper, dancer, singer and beatboxer. He is best known as a member of the South Korean boy group B.A.P.

He made his recording debut with the single ""Never Give Up"" under B.A.P's sub-unit Bang&Zelo in November 2011. He is currently signed under TS Entertainment. ---

