## Toledo, OH Metropolitan Statistical Area
The Toledo, OH Metropolitan Statistical Area is a metropolitan area centered on the American city of Toledo, Ohio. As of the 2010 census, the MSA had a population of 651,429. It is the sixth largest metropolitan area in the state of Ohio, behind Cincinnati-Northern Kentucky, Cleveland, Columbus, Dayton, and Akron.",none,n/a,substring,True,True,True,sentence,,,10,ollama,mxbai-embed-large,1024,hybrid,5,5,2945,,,ollama,local,qwen3.5:2b,Q8_0,hotpotqa,42
