## Orli Znojmo
Orli Znojmo (in English Znojmo Eagles) is a Czech-based ice hockey team that currently plays in the Austrian Hockey League. The club is based in Znojmo and their home arena is Nevoga arena. ---

## Tomáš Klouček
Tomáš Klouček (born March 7, 1980 in Prague, Czechoslovakia) is a Czech professional ice hockey defenceman playing for Czech-based Orli Znojmo, who compete in the Austrian Hockey League (EBEL). He had previously played in the National Hockey League for the New York Rangers, Nashville Predators and the Atlanta Thrashers. He was drafted 131st overall by the Rangers in the 1998 NHL Entry Draft.

